{"final": true, "memory": ["Report the current temperature in Fahrenheit: call api.weather(city), read the 'temp_c' field (Celsius), convert with F = C * 9 / 5 + 32, round to 1 decimal and return the number.", "Report the population of a city as a whole number of people: call api.population(city), read 'millions', multiply by 1,000,000 and return it as an int (round first).", "Report the local hour in the city when it is 12:00 UTC: call api.timezone(city), read 'utc_offset' (hours ahead of UTC) and return (12 + offset) % 24 as an int.", "Report the hemisphere of a city: call api.coords(city), read 'lat'; return the string 'north' if lat > 0 else 'south'.", "Lesson: Report a user's email domain: call api.user_email(user_id), read 'email', and return the part after the '@' exactly as written.", "Lesson: Report a user's age in months: call api.user_age(user_id), read 'age' (years) and return age * 12 as an int.", "Lesson: Report the greeting for a user's city: call api.user_city(user_id), read 'city' and return the string 'Hello from ' + city.", "Report a product's price including 10% tax: call api.price(product_id), read 'usd' (dollars), multiply by 1.1, round to 2 decimals and return the number.", "Report how many full dozens of a product are in stock: call api.stock(product_id), read 'units' and return units // 12.", "Report the shipping cost of a product: call api.weight(product_id), read 'kg' (kilograms) and return round(5 + 2 * kg, 2).", "Lesson: Report the shelf label of a product: call api.category(product_id), read 'category' and convert it to uppercase.", "Lesson: Report the first product added to an order: call `api.order_items(order_id)`, read `items` (a list of `[product_id, quantity]` pairs in cart order), and return the `product_id` of the first pair.", "Lesson: Report whether an order has left the warehouse: call api.order_status(order_id), read 'status' and return True if it is 'shipped' or 'delivered', otherwise False.", "Report the customer reference for an order: call api.order_user(order_id), read 'user_id' and return the string 'CUST-' + user_id.", "Report what 100 USD is worth in a currency: call api.exchange_rate(currency), read 'per_usd' (units per 1 USD), return round(100 * per_usd, 2).", "Report the value of 10 shares: call api.stock_price(ticker), read 'close' (USD per share) and return round(10 * close, 2).", "Lesson: Report the paid holiday hours per year in a country: call api.holiday_count(country), read 'days' and return days * 8.", "Report the driving time in hours between two cities at 80 km/h: call api.distance(city_a, city_b), read 'km' and return round(km / 80, 1).", "Lesson: Report the French word for a label: call api.translate_v2(word), read 'fr' and return it with the first letter capitalized (str.capitalize()).", "Report the reading time of a document in minutes: call api.word_count(doc_id), read 'words' and return round(words / 200, 1)."], "llm_calls": 193, "tokens": 112176, "sec": 2514.9}
